    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00004 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00004-s " data-id="e00004" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00004">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00005-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00005">Anvil Field Systems</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00006-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00006">Model T9 · Rev C · Datasheet 2026-08</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00007 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00007-s " data-id="e00007" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00007">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00008 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00008-s " data-id="e00008" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00008">
    			<h1 data-interaction-id="e00009" class="e-ykrhga-e00009-s e-heading-base">Anvil T9 — full specification</h1>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000a">A 14-inch field laptop built to be repaired with a screwdriver at minus 20 degrees. Everything you need to compare it is on this page, in a table, before you have to talk to anyone.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000b-s " data-id="e0000b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000b">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000c"><a href="#demo" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Request a demo unit
	</a></p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000d">From 3,240 per unit. Stock lead time 12 working days.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000e-s " data-id="e0000e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000e">
    			<img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e0000f-s" data-interaction-id="e0000f" id="24" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-anvil-field-t9-device_field.jpg" width="1024" height="576" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-anvil-field-t9-device_field.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-anvil-field-t9-device_field-300x169.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-anvil-field-t9-device_field-768x432.jpg 768w" alt="Anvil T9 rugged field laptop open on a survey tripod case"/>		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000g-s " data-id="e0000g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000g">
    			<h2 data-interaction-id="e0000h" class="e-ykrhga-e0000h-s e-heading-base">Specification table</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000i">All figures measured, not modelled</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000j-s " data-id="e0000j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000j">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000k-s " data-id="e0000k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000k">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0000l" class="e-ykrhga-e0000l-s e-heading-base">Display</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000m">14in 1400-nit sunlight readable, glove and wet-finger touch, IP68 sealed bezel</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000n">IP68</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000o-s " data-id="e0000o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000o">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0000p" class="e-ykrhga-e0000p-s e-heading-base">Drop</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000q">MIL-STD-810H Method 516.8 Proc IV, 26 drops from 1.5m onto plywood over concrete, powered on</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000r">810H 516.8</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000s-s " data-id="e0000s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000s">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0000t" class="e-ykrhga-e0000t-s e-heading-base">Battery</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000u">Dual hot-swap 74Wh, 11 hours mixed use, swap without shutdown, replaceable in the field in 40 seconds</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000v">2 × 74Wh</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000w-s " data-id="e0000w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000w">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0000x" class="e-ykrhga-e0000x-s e-heading-base">Compute</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000y">Core Ultra 7 165H, 32GB DDR5 (64GB option), two removable NVMe bays up to 4TB each, one with a keyed carrier for classified removal</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000z">32GB · 8TB</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00010 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00010-s " data-id="e00010" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00010">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00011" class="e-ykrhga-e00011-s e-heading-base">Chassis</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00012-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00012">Magnesium alloy frame with replaceable corner bumpers, 2.94kg with both batteries, operating minus 20 to plus 60 degrees</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00013-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00013">2.94 kg</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00014 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00014-s " data-id="e00014" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00014">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00015" class="e-ykrhga-e00015-s e-heading-base">Sealing</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00016-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00016">IP68 dust ingress and 1.5m immersion for 30 minutes, salt fog per Method 509.7, sand and dust per Method 510.7</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00017-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00017">IP68</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00018 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00018-s " data-id="e00018" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00018">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00019" class="e-ykrhga-e00019-s e-heading-base">Service</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001a">Eleven screws to the mainboard. Storage, RAM, battery, keyboard and display bezel are all user-replaceable</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001b">11 screws</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001c-s " data-id="e0001c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001c">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001d" class="e-ykrhga-e0001d-s e-heading-base">Guarantee</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001e">Five years of parts availability from date of purchase, written into the contract, with a 3-year return-to-base repair term</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001f">5 years</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001g-s " data-id="e0001g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001g">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001h-s " data-id="e0001h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001h">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001i-s " data-id="e0001i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001i">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001j-s " data-id="e0001j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001j">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001k">02 · Test results</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0001l" class="e-ykrhga-e0001l-s e-heading-base">Drop, dust and thermal — with the standard cited</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001m">Every figure below comes from a witnessed test at an accredited lab, with the method number printed so you can check it against your own tender wording. Reports are sent as PDFs on request, unredacted.</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001n">Lab: TÜV-accredited, ISO/IEC 17025. Report set ANV-T9-2026-04.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001o e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0001o-s " data-id="e0001o" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0001o">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001p e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001p-s " data-id="e0001p" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001p">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001q">MIL-STD-810H 516.8 Proc IV</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001r" class="e-ykrhga-e0001r-s e-heading-base">Transit drop</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001s">26 / 26 passed</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001t">Twenty-six drops from 1.5m onto 5cm plywood over concrete, powered on, on every face, edge and corner. No data loss, no bezel separation, hinge torque within spec after test.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001u e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001u-s " data-id="e0001u" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001u">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001v">MIL-STD-810H 510.7 · IEC 60529</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001w" class="e-ykrhga-e0001w-s e-heading-base">Dust and water</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001x">IP68 sustained</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001y">Eight hours blowing dust at 8.9 m/s, then 30 minutes at 1.5m immersion. Ports sealed by gasketed doors; the unit was operated wet for one hour afterwards with no thermal fault.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001z-s " data-id="e0001z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001z">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00020-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00020">MIL-STD-810H 501.7 / 502.7</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e00021" class="e-ykrhga-e00021-s e-heading-base">Thermal envelope</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00022-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00022">−20 °C to +60 °C</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00023-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00023">Cold start at minus 20 within 45 seconds, sustained load at plus 60 with no throttle below base clock. Battery hot-swap validated across the full range with gloves on.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00024 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00024-s " data-id="e00024" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00024">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00025 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00025-s " data-id="e00025" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00025">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00026 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00026-s " data-id="e00026" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00026">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00027 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00027-s " data-id="e00027" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00027">
    			<img decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e00028-s" data-interaction-id="e00028" id="25" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-anvil-field-t9-hot_swap.jpg" width="1024" height="768" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-anvil-field-t9-hot_swap.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-anvil-field-t9-hot_swap-300x225.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-anvil-field-t9-hot_swap-768x576.jpg 768w" alt="Gloved hands swapping a hot-swap battery on the Anvil T9"/>					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00029-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00029">Battery B carries the machine while battery A is out. No shutdown, no dock, no tools.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002a-s " data-id="e0002a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002a">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002b">03 · Hot-swap and serviceability</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0002c" class="e-ykrhga-e0002c-s e-heading-base">Eleven screws to the mainboard</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002d">Storage, RAM, battery, keyboard and display bezel are all user-replaceable. Full service manual and part numbers are public and free.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002e-s " data-id="e0002e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002e">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002f-s " data-id="e0002f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002f">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002g">Battery</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002h">Dual 74Wh hot-swap, replaced in the field in 40 seconds, no shutdown — P/N ANV-BT74</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002i-s " data-id="e0002i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002i">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002j">Storage</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002k">Two NVMe bays behind one captive screw, keyed carrier for secure removal — P/N ANV-SSD-C2</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002l-s " data-id="e0002l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002l">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002m">Memory</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002n">Two SODIMM slots, 32GB fitted, 64GB supported — standard DDR5-5600, no proprietary module</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002o-s " data-id="e0002o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002o">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002p">Keyboard</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002q">Sealed backlit unit, four screws from the top deck, replaced without opening the chassis</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002r-s " data-id="e0002r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002r">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002s">Bezel</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002t">Display bezel and corner bumpers are consumables, stocked and priced like consumables</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002u e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002u-s " data-id="e0002u" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002u">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002v">Manual</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002w">Full service manual, exploded diagrams and the complete part-number list are public and free</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002x-s " data-id="e0002x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002x">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002y-s " data-id="e0002y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002y">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002z-s " data-id="e0002z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002z">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00030-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00030">04 · Interfaces</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00031" class="e-ykrhga-e00031-s e-heading-base">Ports, radios and the expansion bay</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00032-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00032">Every port is a real port behind a gasketed door — no dongle is required to reach a serial device, and the expansion bay is specified once and configured at order.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00033 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00033-s " data-id="e00033" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00033">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00034 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00034-s " data-id="e00034" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00034">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00035" class="e-ykrhga-e00035-s e-heading-base">Ports</h3>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00036 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00036-s " data-id="e00036" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00036">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00037-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00037">USB</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00038-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00038">2 × USB-C 40Gbps with 100W PD in, 2 × USB-A 10Gbps</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00039 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00039-s " data-id="e00039" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00039">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003a">Video</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003b">HDMI 2.1 full size, plus dual 4K over either USB-C</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003c-s " data-id="e0003c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003c">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003d">Legacy</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003e">True RS-232 DE-9 serial and RJ-45 2.5GbE, both sealed</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003f-s " data-id="e0003f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003f">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003g">Power</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003h">Locking DC barrel, 12–32V vehicle input tolerant</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003i-s " data-id="e0003i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003i">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0003j" class="e-ykrhga-e0003j-s e-heading-base">Radios</h3>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003k-s " data-id="e0003k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003k">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003l">Cellular</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003m">5G sub-6 with dual physical SIM and eSIM, removable module</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003n-s " data-id="e0003n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003n">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003o">Wireless</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003p">Wi-Fi 7 tri-band, Bluetooth 5.4, both on an M.2 card you can pull</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003q-s " data-id="e0003q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003q">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003r">GNSS</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003s">Dedicated multi-band receiver, sub-metre with correction service</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003t-s " data-id="e0003t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003t">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003u">Kill</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003v">Physical RF kill switch on the left flank, mechanically latched</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003w-s " data-id="e0003w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003w">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0003x" class="e-ykrhga-e0003x-s e-heading-base">Expansion bay</h3>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003y-s " data-id="e0003y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003y">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003z">Option A</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00040-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00040">Smart card and contactless reader, FIPS 201 compatible</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00041 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00041-s " data-id="e00041" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00041">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00042-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00042">Option B</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00043-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00043">Second 2.5GbE plus a fibre SFP cage for substation work</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00044 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00044-s " data-id="e00044" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00044">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00045-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00045">Option C</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00046-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00046">Thermal imager and barcode head for asset inspection</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00047 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00047-s " data-id="e00047" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00047">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00048-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00048">Option D</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00049-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00049">Blanking plate — sealed, and the bay stays field-swappable</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004a-s " data-id="e0004a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004a">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004b-s " data-id="e0004b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004b">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004c-s " data-id="e0004c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004c">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004d-s " data-id="e0004d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004d">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004e">05 · In service</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0004f" class="e-ykrhga-e0004f-s e-heading-base">Three deployments</h2>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004g">Reference sites available under NDA, including the crews who have had units in the field since the T7.</p>
		
</div>
			<img decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e0004h-s" data-interaction-id="e0004h" id="26" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-anvil-field-t9-deployment.jpg" width="1024" height="576" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-anvil-field-t9-deployment.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-anvil-field-t9-deployment-300x169.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-anvil-field-t9-deployment-768x432.jpg 768w" alt="Field crew using the Anvil T9 on a utilities deployment"/>		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004i e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0004i-s " data-id="e0004i" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0004i">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004j-s " data-id="e0004j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004j">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004k">Pipeline</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0004l" class="e-ykrhga-e0004l-s e-heading-base">Pipeline integrity survey</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004m">Inline inspection crews run the T9 off vehicle power at 12–32V, pull data over RS-232 from legacy pigging gear and hot-swap batteries at the valve station instead of driving back to the truck.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004n">Fleet of 240 · 3 years in service</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004o-s " data-id="e0004o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004o">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004p">Forestry</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0004q" class="e-ykrhga-e0004q-s e-heading-base">Forestry inventory</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004r">Wet gloves, rain, and a screen you can still read at noon under canopy gaps. GNSS to sub-metre with correction, and a bezel the crew replaces themselves when a branch wins.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004s">Zero return-to-base in 18 months</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004t-s " data-id="e0004t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004t">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004u">Disaster response</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0004v" class="e-ykrhga-e0004v-s e-heading-base">Disaster response</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004w">Deployed cold at minus 20, booted in 45 seconds, run on generator or vehicle power for a week. The RF kill switch is mechanical, which is what the incident commander asked for.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004x">72-hour deployments, no dock</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004y-s " data-id="e0004y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004y">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004z-s " data-id="e0004z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004z">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00050 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00050-s " data-id="e00050" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00050">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00051 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00051-s " data-id="e00051" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00051">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00052-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00052">06 · Procurement</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00053" class="e-ykrhga-e00053-s e-heading-base">Lead times, frameworks, volume pricing</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00054-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00054">Stock lead time 12 working days. Listed on two national framework agreements. Volume pricing from 25 units, with a written 5-year price hold.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00055 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00055-s " data-id="e00055" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00055">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00056 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00056-s " data-id="e00056" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00056">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00057-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00057">Lead time</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00058-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00058">12 working days from stock, 6 weeks for a configured expansion bay</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00059 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00059-s " data-id="e00059" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00059">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005a">Frameworks</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005b">Listed on two national framework agreements; direct award permitted under both</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005c-s " data-id="e0005c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005c">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005d">Volume</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005e">Tiered pricing from 25 units, again at 100 and 500, quoted in writing</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005f-s " data-id="e0005f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005f">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005g">Price hold</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005h">5-year price hold written into the contract, not a quotation footnote</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005i-s " data-id="e0005i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005i">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005j">Compliance</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005k">Country-of-origin declaration, RoHS and REACH statements, TAA position on request</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005l-s " data-id="e0005l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005l">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005m">Trials</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005n">Demo units shipped free for 30 days, no purchase order needed to start</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005o-s " data-id="e0005o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005o">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005p e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005p-s " data-id="e0005p" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005p">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005q">Unit price</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005r">From 3,240</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005s">Per unit. Demo units shipped free for 30 days and yes, you may drop it.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005t"><a href="#demo" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Request a demo unit
	</a></p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005u e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005u-s " data-id="e0005u" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005u">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005v">In stock now</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005w">412 units of the base configuration are on the shelf. Configured bays build to order on a six-week cycle and ship in tranches if you need the first crews equipped early.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005x-s " data-id="e0005x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005x">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005y-s " data-id="e0005y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005y">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005z-s " data-id="e0005z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005z">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00060-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00060">5</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00061-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00061">Years, contractual</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00062 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00062-s " data-id="e00062" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00062">
    			<h2 data-interaction-id="e00063" class="e-ykrhga-e00063-s e-heading-base">Parts and repair commitment</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00064-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00064">Five years of parts availability from date of purchase, guaranteed in the contract, not the marketing.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00065-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00065">That means stocked batteries, bezels, keyboards and mainboards for five years from the day your unit ships — not five years from the day we stop building the model. Repair turnaround is 10 working days return-to-base, with a loan pool for fleets over 50 units.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00066 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00066-s " data-id="e00066" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00066" id="demo">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00067 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00067-s " data-id="e00067" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00067">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00068-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00068">08 · Trial</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00069" class="e-ykrhga-e00069-s e-heading-base">Request a demo unit</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006a">From 3,240 per unit. Demo units shipped free for 30 days and yes, you may drop it. Tell us the crew, the climate and the software you have to run, and a configured unit goes out on the next courier.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006b"><a href="mailto:demo@anvilfield.example?subject=Anvil%20T9%20demo%20unit" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Request a demo unit
	</a></p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006c">Or ask for the full test report set, the service manual and the framework numbers — all three are sent without a sales call.</p>
		
</div>

</section>

</div>
